Package: SurveyDokum
Title: Automated Documentation for Survey Datasets
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Maria", "Valaste", , "maria.valaste@helsinki.fi", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Automates the documentation of survey datasets through a
    two-stage pipeline: R computes descriptive statistics and detects
    variable roles natively, then a local large language model (via
    'Ollama') turns those statistics into readable prose. Also generates
    'roxygen2' data documentation and 'codebook' reports automatically.
    Open-text survey responses are never included in prompts sent to the
    language model, only aggregate statistics about them.
